## Interface: 11509
## Title: Pathwise
## Notes: Follows your character's progression and tells you what to do next.
## Author: noelagnelius
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: PathwiseDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: PathwiseCharDB

# Interface number: 11509 = Classic Era 1.15.9. Verified in game 2026-10-22 with
#  /dump select(4, GetBuildInfo())  - re-check after each Classic Era patch.

# Pathwise.toc is an identical copy used as a fallback by clients that
# don't pick up the _Vanilla suffix. Keep both files the same
# (tests/run.lua checks this).

# Load order matters:
#  1. Locales     - string table (Pathwise.L)
#  2. Platform    - the only layer that calls flavor-specific WoW API
#  3. Core/Init   - namespace, saved variables, events, callbacks, commands
#  4. Data        - plain Lua tables for this flavor
#  5. Core        - logic modules (never call WoW API directly)
#  6. UI          - frames, popups, slash command binding

Locales\enUS.lua

Platform\Platform_Classic.lua

Core\Init.lua

Data\Classic\ClassSpecs.lua
Data\Classic\StatWeights.lua
Data\Classic\ClassGear.lua

Core\Character.lua
Core\Talents.lua
Core\GearScore.lua
Core\QuestRewards.lua

UI\GoalPrompt.lua
UI\Tooltip.lua
UI\QuestRewardUI.lua
UI\SlashCommands.lua
